sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Buyer
    participant FW as Fee wallet
    participant K as Keeper
    participant C as Creator
    participant T as Treasury

    rect rgb(232, 242, 255)
    Note over P,K: PHASE 1 · PAYMENT
    P->>FW: USDC payment<br/>(gateway batch or direct transfer)
    Note over P,K: fee wallet address = CREATE2 from payout address<br/>no keys · no admin · owned by nobody<br/>contract may not exist yet —<br/>the transfer credits it anyway
    end

    rect rgb(232, 255, 235)
    Note over K,FW: PHASE 2 · SWEEP (~60s)
    K->>FW: distribute()<br/>permissionless —<br/>anyone can call it
    end

    rect rgb(255, 244, 230)
    Note over C,T: PHASE 3 · SPLIT
    FW->>C: 99%
    FW->>T: 1%
    Note over C,T: each sweep pays out:<br/>99% creator · 1% treasury<br/>fee starts at 1%, hard cap 5%<br/>any change waits days in a<br/>public timelock first
    end

    Note over P,T: NIBGATE HOLDS NO KEY HERE<br/>cannot move, freeze,<br/>or redirect creator funds
